===Saffron Gym===
[[File:Saffron Gym RBY.png|thumb|Saffron Gym]]

{{sign|RBY|header}}
{{sign|RBY|title|SAFFRON CITY POKéMON GYM<br>LEADER: SABRINA}}
{{sign|RBY|The Master of<br>Psychic Pokémon!}}
{{sign|RBY|footer}}

The [[Saffron Gym]] specializes in {{t|Psychic}} Pokémon. Only {{t|Bug}} attacks deal super effective damage to them, but the few available Bug moves are relatively weak. Psychic Pokémon typically have low {{stat|Defense}}, so it is better to use moves that deal physical damage, like {{t|Normal}}-, {{t|Flying}}-, and {{type|Rock}} attacks.

The Gym uses {{DL|Saffron Gym|Generations I-IV|a series of warp panels}} to confuse and disorient any challengers. Step on the panel near the entrance to reach the southeast room. To reach the Gym Leader by using as few warps as possible, continue by stepping on the northwest, southwest, and southwest panels in the following rooms. This leads to the center room, where [[Sabrina]] awaits anyone up to the challenge.

